WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Edit one accurate sentence

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.220
Find the main verb and the subject that controls it.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.220
Check whether the subject is singular or plural.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:18.550
Find the time cue and match the tense to it. Read the sentence aloud once.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:27.830
In ‘The list of topics is ready’, the main subject is ‘list’. The intervening phrase ‘of topics’ does not change the verb.
